# reglookup 1.0.1: exact SConstruct source inventory without a SCons provider
id: E999
draft: true
contributor_id: 2501_91199785
trigger_tool: conan|scons|clang
phase: build
severity: 2
category: build-system, scons, dependency-path, ohos
error_signature: "scons: not found|No module named SCons|talloc.h.*file not found"
match_keywords: "SCons, SConstruct, small source inventory, direct clang, talloc, hard-coded /usr, reglookup"
title: "SCons 构建工具不可用时，从 SConstruct 提取精确源文件与链接图而非盲目安装系统包"
root_cause: "老 SCons 项目的 SConstruct 同时含核心源码清单和与目标机不兼容的 /usr 默认路径；目标机缺 SCons 且制品仓没有配方时，直接安装系统工具或沿用硬编码路径都不可复现。"
affected_scope: "源码/构建图规模小、SConstruct 列表可完整审计的 C/C++ 库；不适用复杂生成器、自定义 Builder 有实际产物依赖的项目。"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: "extract-sconstruct-source-link-graph"
rec_description: "从 SConstruct 枚举库对象、程序入口、LIBS/CPPPATH/LIBPATH；只对这些源文件用目标编译器构建，将第三方头文件/库路径改由 Conan dependency cpp_info 提供。静态/共享产物及 SONAME 必须与上游一致；用安装后公开 API 的真实消费者测试验收。独立的文档/Python Builder 不能默认为 C 核心的必需步骤，但要在功能范围说明中披露未交付模块。"
rec_command: "inspect SConstruct lib_src and env.Program; conan create . -pr:h=<ohos-profile> -pr:b=<ohos-profile>"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: "conan-recipe"
forbid_1_pattern: "CPPPATH=.*'/usr/include'|LIBPATH=.*'/usr/lib'"
forbid_1_reason: "目标机依赖通过 Conan 包提供，不得依赖系统固定目录。"
forbid_1_consequence: "头文件/链接包错配或在 CI 中缺失。"
similar_to: "DRAFT-10175-rmlint-2.10.3-scons-sandbox-bootstrap-env-inline（保留 SCons 的工具环境修法）"
